    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the security measures that will be implemented to ensure the compliance of The solution with all regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with various regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS v2 (ANSSI), SecNumCloud, NIS2 Directive, and eIDAS." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "DPO contact is dpo@nexus-engineering.it." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with all regulatory requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement the following security measures: 1. **Data protection**: As Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are GDPR compliant and have ISO 27001 certification with a scope that includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure that all personal data is protected in accordance with GDPR regulations. 2. **Data encryption and anonymization**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will use Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing tools for anonymization, such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, to ensure that all data is encrypted and anonymized if necessary. 3. **No data transfer outside the European Union**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency policy is EU only, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers by default unless there is an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will adhere to a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers by default unless there is an explicit legal basis to ensure no data is transferred outside the European Union. 4. **SecNumCloud infrastructure or equivalent**: Although Nexus Engineering S.r.l. context does not explicitly mention using SecNumCloud infrastructure, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. do have experience with RGS v2 (ANSSI) and have worked on multiple SecNumCloud projects (3 projects)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution is deployed on an infrastructure that meets the sovereignty constraints. 5. **Access control and authentication**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. access control standards include multi-factor authentication (MFA) enforced with TOTP and hardware token (FIDO2), role-based access control (RBAC) design experience, and privileged access management (PAM) solutions like CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement these measures to ensure that only authorized personnel have access to the data. 6. **Network security**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. network security architecture patterns include Zero-trust, micro-segmentation, and defence-in-depth." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement Our network security architecture patterns to protect against unauthorized access and ensure the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing the security measures that will be implemented to ensure the compliance of this solution with all regulatory requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution complies with all regulatory requirements, including GDPR, sovereignty constraints, and SecNumCloud infrastructure type or equivalent, while guaranteeing strict compliance to data protection regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires that the solution comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR, sovereignty constraints, and SecNumCloud infrastructure type or equivalent. the solution must also respect the budgetary capacities of the local authority and demonstrate an approach to optimizing costs while guaranteeing the expected service level." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the legal risks associated with the solution, and how will we ensure that all contractual and regulatory requirements are met?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Counsel for we, I can confirm that we has experience in public procurement and is familiar with EU regulations, including GDPR. we have a standard legal basis for processing personal data under Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR, which is the performance of a task in the public interest." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding sovereignty constraints, we ensure that all client data remains within EU, as required by the client's constraints. we subcontracting policy also requires that all subcontractors be EU-established, which aligns with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the SecNumCloud infrastructure type or equivalent, we can work with cloud providers that meet these standards, ensuring compliance with the relevant regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of budgetary capacities, we will need to ensure that we solution is tailored to meet the local authority budget constraints. we standard limitation of liability is 3 million euros, and we have professional indemnity insurance coverage of 5 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate legal risks associated with the solution, we will: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Conduct a thorough review of the client's requirements and constraints to ensure that we solution complies with all regulatory requirements. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Work closely with the client's to understand the client's specific needs and budgetary constraints. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensure that all subcontractors are thoroughly vetted and comply with EU regulations and the client's requirements. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Implement robust data protection measures to ensure compliance with GDPR and other relevant regulations. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Develop a comprehensive contract that outlines we obligations, liabilities, and responsibilities, as well as those of the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By taking these steps, we can ensure that all contractual and regulatory requirements are met, and that the solution is delivered in accordance with the client's needs and expectations. we typical contractual clauses include a standard SLA penalty mechanism, termination for cause and convenience notice periods, data return and destruction obligations upon termination, and an annual price revision mechanism capped at the official national index. we will also ensure that we solution is designed as a tool of assistance, with explicit validation by an agent for any automated decisions. we approach will be to provide a transparent and explainable solution, with recommendations or proposals that can be understood and justified." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget for this project is 3,000,000 euros, and the duration is 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is the projected margin for this contract, and what cost-optimization strategies can we propose to ensure that the solution is delivered within budget?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate the projected margin for this contract, we need to first determine the revenue." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget for this projectt is 3,000,000 euros, and we will assume the revenue is the revenue.  the projected margin for this contract would be 3,000,000 euros * 28% = 840,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, our company context mentions that a 10% budget reduction can be absorbed via rate renegotiation with subcontractors, and a 20% budget reduction would require scope reduction by removing optional modules or reducing training days.  we could propose to the client's that we work together to identify areas where costs can be optimized without compromising the quality of the solution, such as streamlining processes, reducing waste, or improving efficiency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we could offer flexible pricing models, such as milestone-based payments or performance-based incentives, to align we interests with the client's and ensure that we are both working towards the same goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is also worth noting that we has a minimum acceptable margin of 18%, so we would need to ensure that any cost-optimization strategies do not compromise we ability to meet a minimum acceptable margin of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide assistance with the consultation of information, help with drafting administrative contents, and accompany agents in agents administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with existing practices of the agents and comply with regulatory requirements such as GDPR and sovereignty constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the AI components that will be used to deliver The solution, and how will we ensure that the AI components that will be used to deliver this solution meet all the technical and functional requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To deliver a solution that meets the client's requirements, we can utilize we expertise in AI, specifically leveraging we experience with large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The primary AI component for providing assistance with the consultation of information and help with drafting administrative contents would be we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable, complying with sovereignty constraints. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable, complying with sovereignty constraints can be fine-tuned using we preferred methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to achieve domain-specific accuracy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integrating with existing practices of the agents, we would employ a hybrid approach combining natural language processing (NLP) and machine learning algorithms to ensure seamless interaction with the agents current workflow. we RAG capabilities, including dense vector semantic retrieval and BM25 sparse retrieval strategies, can be instrumental in providing relevant information to agents by searching through internal procedures, applicable regulatory texts, and other documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with GDPR and sovereignty constraints, we ensure that all data processing and model training occur within the European Union, using hosting solutions like SecNumCloud or equivalent, which meet the necessary security and privacy standards. we approach to data protection includes strict access controls, encryption of data at rest and in transit, and anonymization of personal data when necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution will be designed with explicability in mind, allowing for the tracing of recommendations or proposals back to recommendations or proposals source information, thereby ensuring transparency and trustworthiness." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This can be achieved through techniques such as source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, which are part of we explainability and trust toolkit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that the AI components meet all technical and functional requirements, we will follow a rigorous development and testing process. a rigorous development and testing process includes conducting thorough risk assessments, performing regular security audits, and implementing continuous monitoring to identify and address any potential issues promptly. we approach is also aligned with budgetary constraints, aiming for cost optimization while guaranteeing the expected service level." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, we goal is to provide an intelligent assistance tool that not only assists agents in agents daily missions but also improves the efficiency of administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users, all while respecting regulatory requirements and sovereignty constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires that the solution contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact. the solution must also demonstrate an approach to sustainable development and comply with the city's policy of sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the sustainability measures that will be implemented to ensure that the solution meets all environmental requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client environmental requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement several sustainability measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution will rely on green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy. rely will significantly reduce the carbon footprint of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy have a high level of energy efficiency, with a Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28, respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement digital sobriety practices to reduce energy consumption. digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, which reduces recompute by an estimated 20%, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution is designed to reduce energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
